{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-databases","title":"图数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-and-newdb/graph-databases","wordCount":609,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"图数据库\">图数据库</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图数据库以**节点（Node）<strong>和</strong>关系（Relationship）**为核心数据模型，专门用于存储和查询高度关联的数据。在社交网络、推荐系统、知识图谱等场景中，图数据库的性能远超关系数据库的多表 JOIN。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A((Alice)) --&gt;|FOLLOWS| B((Bob))&#10;    A --&gt;|LIKES| P1[Post: 图数据库入门]&#10;    B --&gt;|FOLLOWS| C((Carol))&#10;    B --&gt;|WROTE| P1&#10;    C --&gt;|FOLLOWS| A&#10;    C --&gt;|LIKES| P1\">graph LR\n    A((Alice)) --&gt;|FOLLOWS| B((Bob))\n    A --&gt;|LIKES| P1[Post: 图数据库入门]\n    B --&gt;|FOLLOWS| C((Carol))\n    B --&gt;|WROTE| P1\n    C --&gt;|FOLLOWS| A\n    C --&gt;|LIKES| P1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>图数据库</th>\n<th>关系数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据模型</td>\n<td>节点 + 关系 + 属性</td>\n<td>表 + 行 + 列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联查询</td>\n<td>遍历关系（O(1) 每步）</td>\n<td>JOIN（O(n) 扫描）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度关联</td>\n<td>多跳遍历高效</td>\n<td>多表 JOIN 性能骤降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema</td>\n<td>灵活标签</td>\n<td>严格模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>高度关联数据</td>\n<td>结构化事务数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"属性图模型\">属性图模型</h2><p>属性图（Property Graph）是最常用的图数据模型，由节点、关系和属性三要素组成。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点</td>\n<td>实体，可有标签（Label）</td>\n<td>(:User {name: &quot;Alice&quot;})</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系</td>\n<td>有向连接，有类型和属性</td>\n<td>-[:FOLLOWS {since: 2024}]-&gt;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性</td>\n<td>键值对，附着在节点或关系上</td>\n<td>name: &quot;Alice&quot;, age: 28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签</td>\n<td>节点的分类标记</td>\n<td>:User, :Post, :Product</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 属性图示例&#10;        U1[&quot;(:User)\\nname: Alice\\nage: 28&quot;]&#10;        U2[&quot;(:User)\\nname: Bob\\nage: 32&quot;]&#10;        P1[&quot;(:Post)\\ntitle: 图数据库\\nlikes: 42&quot;]&#10;        U1 --&gt;|&quot;FOLLOWS\\nsince: 2024&quot;| U2&#10;        U1 --&gt;|&quot;WROTE\\nat: 2024-03&quot;| P1&#10;        U2 --&gt;|&quot;LIKED&quot;| P1&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 属性图示例\n        U1[\"(:User)\\nname: Alice\\nage: 28\"]\n        U2[\"(:User)\\nname: Bob\\nage: 32\"]\n        P1[\"(:Post)\\ntitle: 图数据库\\nlikes: 42\"]\n        U1 --&gt;|\"FOLLOWS\\nsince: 2024\"| U2\n        U1 --&gt;|\"WROTE\\nat: 2024-03\"| P1\n        U2 --&gt;|\"LIKED\"| P1\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"neo4j-与-cypher-查询\">Neo4j 与 Cypher 查询</h2><p>Neo4j 是最流行的图数据库，Cypher 是其声明式查询语言。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本-crud\">基本 CRUD</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"// 创建节点&#10;CREATE (alice:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;, age: 28, email: &#39;alice@example.com&#39;})&#10;CREATE (bob:User {name: &#39;Bob&#39;, age: 32})&#10;CREATE (post:Post {title: &#39;图数据库入门&#39;, content: &#39;...&#39;, createdAt: datetime()})&#10;&#10;// 创建关系&#10;MATCH (a:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;}), (b:User {name: &#39;Bob&#39;})&#10;CREATE (a)-[:FOLLOWS {since: date(&#39;2024-01-15&#39;)}]-&gt;(b)&#10;&#10;MATCH (a:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;}), (p:Post {title: &#39;图数据库入门&#39;})&#10;CREATE (a)-[:WROTE {at: datetime()}]-&gt;(p)&#10;&#10;// 查询&#10;MATCH (u:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:FOLLOWS]-&gt;(friend)&#10;RETURN friend.name, friend.age&#10;&#10;// 更新&#10;MATCH (u:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})&#10;SET u.age = 29, u.updatedAt = datetime()&#10;&#10;// 删除（先删关系再删节点）&#10;MATCH (u:User {name: &#39;temp&#39;})-[r]-()&#10;DELETE r, u\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 创建节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (alice:User {name: 'Alice', age: 28, email: 'alice@example.com'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (bob:User {name: 'Bob', age: 32})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (post:Post {title: '图数据库入门', content: '...', createdAt: datetime()})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 创建关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:User {name: 'Alice'}), (b:User {name: 'Bob'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (a)-[:FOLLOWS {since: date('2024-01-15')}]->(b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:User {name: 'Alice'}), (p:Post {title: '图数据库入门'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (a)-[:WROTE {at: datetime()}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u:User {name: 'Alice'})-[:FOLLOWS]->(friend)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN friend.name, friend.age</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u:User {name: 'Alice'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SET u.age = 29, u.updatedAt = datetime()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 删除（先删关系再删节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u:User {name: 'temp'})-[r]-()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DELETE r, u</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图遍历查询\">图遍历查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"// 二度好友（朋友的朋友）&#10;MATCH (me:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:FOLLOWS]-&gt;()-[:FOLLOWS]-&gt;(fof:User)&#10;WHERE fof &lt;&gt; me&#10;  AND NOT (me)-[:FOLLOWS]-&gt;(fof)&#10;RETURN DISTINCT fof.name&#10;&#10;// 可变长度路径：1到3度关系&#10;MATCH (me:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:FOLLOWS*1..3]-&gt;(distant:User)&#10;RETURN DISTINCT distant.name, length(shortestPath((me)-[:FOLLOWS*]-&gt;(distant))) AS distance&#10;&#10;// 最短路径&#10;MATCH p = shortestPath(&#10;    (a:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:FOLLOWS*..6]-(b:User {name: &#39;Dave&#39;})&#10;)&#10;RETURN p, length(p) AS hops\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 二度好友（朋友的朋友）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (me:User {name: 'Alice'})-[:FOLLOWS]->()-[:FOLLOWS]->(fof:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE fof &#x3C;> me</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND NOT (me)-[:FOLLOWS]->(fof)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN DISTINCT fof.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 可变长度路径：1到3度关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (me:User {name: 'Alice'})-[:FOLLOWS*1..3]->(distant:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN DISTINCT distant.name, length(shortestPath((me)-[:FOLLOWS*]->(distant))) AS distance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 最短路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH p = shortestPath(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (a:User {name: 'Alice'})-[:FOLLOWS*..6]-(b:User {name: 'Dave'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN p, length(p) AS hops</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cypher 模式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>(n)</td>\n<td>任意节点</td>\n<td>MATCH (n) RETURN n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(n:Label)</td>\n<td>带标签的节点</td>\n<td>MATCH (u:User) RETURN u</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(a)-[r]-&gt;(b)</td>\n<td>有向关系</td>\n<td>(a)-[:FOLLOWS]-&gt;(b)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(a)-[r*1..3]-&gt;(b)</td>\n<td>可变长度路径</td>\n<td>1 到 3 跳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>shortestPath</td>\n<td>最短路径</td>\n<td>shortestPath((a)-[*]-(b))</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"社交网络用例\">社交网络用例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"// 共同好友推荐&#10;MATCH (me:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:FOLLOWS]-&gt;(mutual)&lt;-[:FOLLOWS]-(recommended:User)&#10;WHERE NOT (me)-[:FOLLOWS]-&gt;(recommended)&#10;  AND recommended &lt;&gt; me&#10;RETURN recommended.name, COUNT(mutual) AS mutualFriends&#10;ORDER BY mutualFriends DESC&#10;LIMIT 10&#10;&#10;// 影响力分析：某用户的关注者网络&#10;MATCH (influencer:User {name: &#39;Bob&#39;})&lt;-[:FOLLOWS*1..2]-(follower:User)&#10;RETURN COUNT(DISTINCT follower) AS reach&#10;&#10;// 社区检测：紧密连接的群组&#10;CALL gds.louvain.stream(&#39;social-graph&#39;)&#10;YIELD nodeId, communityId&#10;RETURN gds.util.asNode(nodeId).name AS user, communityId&#10;ORDER BY communityId\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 共同好友推荐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (me:User {name: 'Alice'})-[:FOLLOWS]->(mutual)&#x3C;-[:FOLLOWS]-(recommended:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE NOT (me)-[:FOLLOWS]->(recommended)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND recommended &#x3C;> me</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN recommended.name, COUNT(mutual) AS mutualFriends</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY mutualFriends DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 影响力分析：某用户的关注者网络</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (influencer:User {name: 'Bob'})&#x3C;-[:FOLLOWS*1..2]-(follower:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN COUNT(DISTINCT follower) AS reach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 社区检测：紧密连接的群组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.louvain.stream('social-graph')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD nodeId, communityId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN gds.util.asNode(nodeId).name AS user, communityId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY communityId</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"推荐系统用例\">推荐系统用例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"// 协同过滤：买了X的人也买了Y&#10;MATCH (target:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(p:Product)&lt;-[:PURCHASED]-(other:User)&#10;      -[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(rec:Product)&#10;WHERE NOT (target)-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(rec)&#10;RETURN rec.name, COUNT(DISTINCT other) AS score&#10;ORDER BY score DESC&#10;LIMIT 5&#10;&#10;// 基于图的商品推荐&#10;MATCH (u:User {name: &#39;Alice&#39;})-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(p:Product)-[:BELONGS_TO]-&gt;(cat:Category)&#10;      &lt;-[:BELONGS_TO]-(rec:Product)&#10;WHERE NOT (u)-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(rec)&#10;  AND rec.rating &gt; 4.0&#10;RETURN DISTINCT rec.name, rec.rating, cat.name AS category&#10;ORDER BY rec.rating DESC&#10;LIMIT 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 协同过滤：买了X的人也买了Y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (target:User {name: 'Alice'})-[:PURCHASED]->(p:Product)&#x3C;-[:PURCHASED]-(other:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      -[:PURCHASED]->(rec:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE NOT (target)-[:PURCHASED]->(rec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN rec.name, COUNT(DISTINCT other) AS score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY score DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 基于图的商品推荐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u:User {name: 'Alice'})-[:PURCHASED]->(p:Product)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(cat:Category)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;-[:BELONGS_TO]-(rec:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE NOT (u)-[:PURCHASED]->(rec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND rec.rating > 4.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN DISTINCT rec.name, rec.rating, cat.name AS category</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY rec.rating DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 10</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"知识图谱用例\">知识图谱用例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"// 构建知识图谱&#10;CREATE (py:Tech {name: &#39;Python&#39;})-[:USED_FOR]-&gt;(:Domain {name: &#39;机器学习&#39;})&#10;CREATE (py)-[:HAS_FRAMEWORK]-&gt;(:Framework {name: &#39;PyTorch&#39;})&#10;CREATE (py)-[:HAS_FRAMEWORK]-&gt;(:Framework {name: &#39;TensorFlow&#39;})&#10;&#10;// 查询技术关联&#10;MATCH path = (start:Tech {name: &#39;Python&#39;})-[*1..3]-(related)&#10;RETURN path\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 构建知识图谱</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (py:Tech {name: 'Python'})-[:USED_FOR]->(:Domain {name: '机器学习'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (py)-[:HAS_FRAMEWORK]->(:Framework {name: 'PyTorch'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (py)-[:HAS_FRAMEWORK]->(:Framework {name: 'TensorFlow'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 查询技术关联</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH path = (start:Tech {name: 'Python'})-[*1..3]-(related)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN path</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"图数据库与关系数据库对比\">图数据库与关系数据库对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询场景</th>\n<th>关系数据库</th>\n<th>图数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二度好友</td>\n<td>3 表 JOIN</td>\n<td>2 跳遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最短路径</td>\n<td>递归 CTE（复杂）</td>\n<td>shortestPath（内置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐系统</td>\n<td>多表 JOIN + 子查询</td>\n<td>路径模式匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据量增长影响</td>\n<td>JOIN 性能线性下降</td>\n<td>局部遍历，性能稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引与性能\">索引与性能</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"// 创建索引&#10;CREATE INDEX FOR (u:User) ON (u.name)&#10;CREATE INDEX FOR (u:User) ON (u.email)&#10;&#10;// 复合索引&#10;CREATE INDEX FOR (p:Product) ON (p.category, p.rating)&#10;&#10;// 全文索引&#10;CREATE FULLTEXT INDEX searchIndex FOR (n:Post) ON EACH [n.title, n.content]&#10;&#10;// 约束&#10;CREATE CONSTRAINT FOR (u:User) REQUIRE u.email IS UNIQUE\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 创建索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE INDEX FOR (u:User) ON (u.name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE INDEX FOR (u:User) ON (u.email)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 复合索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE INDEX FOR (p:Product) ON (p.category, p.rating)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 全文索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE FULLTEXT INDEX searchIndex FOR (n:Post) ON EACH [n.title, n.content]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE CONSTRAINT FOR (u:User) REQUIRE u.email IS UNIQUE</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((图数据库))&#10;    属性图模型&#10;      节点 + 标签&#10;      关系 + 属性&#10;      有向图&#10;    Cypher 查询&#10;      模式匹配&#10;      路径遍历&#10;      最短路径&#10;    典型用例&#10;      社交网络&#10;      推荐系统&#10;      知识图谱&#10;      欺诈检测&#10;    优势&#10;      关联查询高效&#10;      深度遍历稳定&#10;      直觉数据建模\">mindmap\n  root((图数据库))\n    属性图模型\n      节点 + 标签\n      关系 + 属性\n      有向图\n    Cypher 查询\n      模式匹配\n      路径遍历\n      最短路径\n    典型用例\n      社交网络\n      推荐系统\n      知识图谱\n      欺诈检测\n    优势\n      关联查询高效\n      深度遍历稳定\n      直觉数据建模</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>图数据库</strong>以节点和关系为核心，遍历关联数据的性能远超关系数据库的 JOIN。</li>\n<li><strong>Cypher</strong> 是 Neo4j 的声明式查询语言，模式匹配语法直观表达图结构。</li>\n<li><strong>社交网络</strong>（共同好友、影响力分析）和<strong>推荐系统</strong>（协同过滤）是图数据库的典型应用。</li>\n<li>图数据库的关联查询性能不随数据量增长而下降，因为遍历是局部操作。</li>\n<li>图数据库适合<strong>关联密集</strong>的数据，结构化事务数据仍应使用关系数据库。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图数据库","id":"图数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"属性图模型","id":"属性图模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Neo4j 与 Cypher 查询","id":"neo4j-与-cypher-查询"},{"level":3,"text":"基本 CRUD","id":"基本-crud"},{"level":3,"text":"图遍历查询","id":"图遍历查询"},{"level":2,"text":"社交网络用例","id":"社交网络用例"},{"level":2,"text":"推荐系统用例","id":"推荐系统用例"},{"level":2,"text":"知识图谱用例","id":"知识图谱用例"},{"level":2,"text":"图数据库与关系数据库对比","id":"图数据库与关系数据库对比"},{"level":2,"text":"索引与性能","id":"索引与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"列族存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-and-newdb/column-family"},"next":null}